From e4b1730fbc5e5ab124ddd8e460fca96a37e3213f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:37:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): nothing of an old stop survives into the next

One Stop token and one landed() rule for late replies (save, finish,
take, reset, format, reloads, Abort); a stop's question ends with it;
formatOutcomes is store-owned; StopMovedOn lists again.

Refs #1369-#1382
